sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Shift as Shift
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Shift: cancel(reason)
    Note over Shift: Policies: shiftRead, shiftWrite, shiftExecute
    Note over Shift: Guards (3)
    Shift->>Shift: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;scheduled#quot; or self.status == #quot;started#quot;
    Shift->>Shift: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Shift->>Shift: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;workforceManageAccess#quot;)
    Shift->>Shift: compute.previousStatus
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.status
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.cancelledAt
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.cancellationReason
    Shift->>EventBus: emit ShiftCancelled on shift.cancelled
    Shift-->>-Client: void